.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-commit\-comment\-create \- Create a comment on a commit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli commit comment create [<owner>/<repo>] <sha> (\-\-body <text> | \-\-body\-file <path\-or\->) [flags]
